  "about": "Riven's default resource mappings (mappings-v1), Riven's own and vanilla blocks only, so always complete. Roles name the materials features use, each an ordered list of block states whose first loaded entry wins. Biomes may override a riven: biome's grass and foliage colours (#RRGGBB). Integration layers (one per supported mod, applied when that mod is loaded) and pack layers (config/riven/mappings/*.json, in file-name order) add, replace or extend entries by key. A world resolves every layer once, when it is created, into data/riven/definitions.json and generates from that snapshot for life.",
